  "historyNote": "#9381, eff 1-31-09, EXPIRED: 1-31-17 New. #12464, eff 1-23-18 (from Ph 1103.02); amd by #13007, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 3-20-20, EXPIRED: 9-16-20 (in para (b), and (b) in #12464 effective again pursuant to RSA 541-A:18, V)",
